{"about_the_game":"A physics sandbox game for people who like to play with digital toys. Create, control toys and define your goals.<br><br>If you're not too great at construction - don't worry! You can just change the developer's sample to suit your taste.<br><br><strong>CREATE VARIOUS ACTIONS OF TOYS.</strong> <br>- Walk, shoot, fly, catch, board, hang, stab, hit, operation, spawn, dance, robotics, transform.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/extras/d1590e9be1fff63a75fd0faf6d59ee40.poster.avif?t=1663146652\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/extras/d1590e9be1fff63a75fd0faf6d59ee40.webm?t=1663146652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/extras/d1590e9be1fff63a75fd0faf6d59ee40.mp4?t=1663146652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CREATE VARIOUS GOALS AND GET A SENSE OF ACCOMPLISHMENT.</strong> <br>- Arrive, escape, rescue, survival, kill, destroy, competition with AI, docking.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/extras/c54f5db4328c9f7bd8dfa400cc0c2c18.poster.avif?t=1663146652\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/extras/c54f5db4328c9f7bd8dfa400cc0c2c18.webm?t=1663146652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/extras/c54f5db4328c9f7bd8dfa400cc0c2c18.mp4?t=1663146652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>SHARE CREATIONS THROUGH STEAM WORKSHOP.</strong> <br>- You can also download, play, modify, and recreate other players' toys.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1381650?t=1663146652","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1663146652","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1663146652","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1663146652","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Workshop","id":30},{"description":"Includes level editor","id":17},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"A physics sandbox game for people who like to play with digital toys. Create, control toys and define your goals.<br><br>If you're not too great at construction - don't worry! You can just change the developer's sample to suit your taste.<br><br><strong>CREATE VARIOUS ACTIONS OF TOYS.</strong> <br>- Walk, shoot, fly, catch, board, hang, stab, hit, operation, spawn, dance, robotics, transform.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/extras/d1590e9be1fff63a75fd0faf6d59ee40.poster.avif?t=1663146652\" width=600 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/extras/d1590e9be1fff63a75fd0faf6d59ee40.webm?t=1663146652\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1381650/extras/d1590e9be1fff63a75fd0faf6d59ee40.mp4?t=1663146652\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>CREATE VARIOUS GOALS AND GET A SENSE OF ACCOMPLISHMENT.</strong> <br>- Arrive, escape, rescue, survival, kill, destroy, competition with AI, docking.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted